ts largest and longest-running day of service.","source_url":"https://www.marquette.edu/service/community-day-of-service.php","source_title":"Marquette Community Day of Service","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to Marquette community members; scheduled for April 18, 2026.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"marquette-christmas-tree-lighting","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Marquette Christmas Tree Lighting Ceremony","title":"Gather in Westowne Square","subtitle":"Annual campus Christmas tree lighting","notes":"Gather at Westowne Square for carols, a blessing and the lighting ceremony; the event uses a permanent tree planted beside the Alumni Memorial Union.","short_summary":"An annual campus holiday gathering with music, prayer and a tree lighting.","evidence_claim":"Marquette hosted its annual Christmas tree lighting in Westowne Square in 2025, with the pep band, All-Campus Choir, presidential remarks and a blessing.","source_url":"https://www.marquette.edu/news-center/2025/marquette-hosting-christmas-tree-lighting-dec-2.php","source_title":"Photo/Video Advisory: Marquette University hosting Christmas tree lighting, Dec. 2","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-12-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The 2025 ceremony was open to the public and began at 4:45 p.m. in Westowne Square.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"marquette-o-fest","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"O-Fest","title":"Club-shop on Central Mall","subtitle":"Organization Fest and Community Service Fair","notes":"Walk Central Mall during O-Fest to speak with organization representatives, explore campus departments and sign up for groups that interest you.","short_summary":"Marquette’s recurring early-fall student-